<title>USA: Poland Communications issues $130 mln 144a debt.</title>
<headline>Poland Communications issues $130 mln 144a debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following rule 144a high-yield debt issue from Poland Communications Inc was priced on Thursday, according to a high-yield market source.</p>
<p>The issue was increased in size by $30 million, the source confirmed.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc is lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER POLAND COMMUNICATIONS INC</p>
<p>AMT $130 MLN	  COUPON 9.875	MATURITY 11/01/2003</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES   ISS PRICE 99.625  FIRST PAY DATE 5/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY B2	 YIELD 9.951 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-MINUS   SPREAD 350 BP     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>NOTES THREE YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 33 PCT AT 109.875.</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
